</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a0c02784-9b4b-11f1-b858-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-07T151753Z-487940382-RC247HA8LWC2-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP-TARIFFS-CANADA.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a0c02784-9b4b-11f1-b858-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-07T151753Z-487940382-RC247HA8LWC2-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP-TARIFFS-CANADA.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">a5d91e1a-9b4b-11f1-9020-4713565d1ebb</guid><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 21:27:42 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a0c02784-9b4b-11f1-b858-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-07T151753Z-487940382-RC247HA8LWC2-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP-TARIFFS-CANADA.jpg">REUTERS - Evelyn Hockstein</source><dc:creator>安娜</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>法国将驱逐两名伊朗外交官 报复德黑兰对等措施</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260818-%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E5%B0%86%E9%A9%B1%E9%80%90%E4%B8%A4%E5%90%8D%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4%E5%AE%98-%E6%8A%A5%E5%A4%8D%E5%BE%B7%E9%BB%91%E5%85%B0%E5%AF%B9%E7%AD%89%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD</link><description>
